<title>BRAZIL: Brazil reaffirms Telebras '96 profit.</title>
<headline>Brazil reaffirms Telebras '96 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Communications Minister Sergio Motta reaffirmed that federally owned telecommunications firm Telebras posted a 1996 profit in excess of 3.0 billion reais.</p>
<p>Motta said final results had still not been tallied but the firm's profit &quot;was in excess of 3.0 billion reais.&quot;</p>
<p>Earlier this month Motta caused a stir when he announced that Telebras had posted a 3.2 billion reais profit, a figure the company said was not its final result.</p>
<p>Motta was speaking to reporters at the inauguration of a committee to oversee the privatization of Brazil's massive telecommunications sector.</p>
<p>((--Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom, 5561 223-0358))</p>
